# Vivi Ornitier's amount is its power when the mana is added, and its power is whatever the layers say then. Battlefield
# Improvisation gives it +2/+2 until end of turn, and casting that noncreature spell puts a +1/+1 counter on it as well,
# so the activation adds three mana, each of the three colours chosen on its own (CR 106.1b): {U}{R}{R}.

